    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d51">

                <pb facs="0252" n="227" sameAs="frus:frus1977-80v04/pg227"/>

                <head>51. Memorandum From Secretary of Defense Brown to President Carter<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d51-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1978-02-25">February 25,
                        1978</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>You will recall that at the session in the NMCC
                    last month<anchor n="2" xml:id="d51-f2"/> you asked for more information on what
                    U.S. and Soviet laser capabilities are today and what they will be in the
                    future.</p>
                <p>The attached is a response to that request.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">Harold
                            Brown</hi></signed></closer>






                <xi:include href="d51-a1.xml" xpointer="d51-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d51-a2.xml" xpointer="d51-a2"/>
                <xi:include href="d51-a3.xml" xpointer="d51-a3"/>
            </div>
